# Validator Event Component

Concrete validator monitoring event implementations for balance, status, and withdrawal credential alerts.

## Key Integration Pattern
- Use string builder pattern for efficient string concatenation in description methods
- Format ETH balances with appropriate decimal precision (4 decimal places)

## Important Constraints
- Always include UTC timestamps in standardized format
- Balance values must be stored in wei (uint64) and converted for display